/F1 18 Tf 72 720 Td (The Lighthouses of Merrow Bay) Tj T* T*
/F1 11 Tf
(This guide describes the five lighthouses that protect Merrow Bay, a fictional) Tj T*
(harbour on a rocky northern coast. Each chapter covers one lighthouse: its history,) Tj T*
(its keepers, and the light it shows at night. The bay was charted in 1791 by Captain) Tj T*
(Elsbeth Varga, who named it after the merrow, a sea spirit from local folklore.) Tj T*
(Shipwrecks on the Hollin Reef were common until the first light was lit. Today all) Tj T*
(five lights are automated, but the keepers' cottages remain open to visitors from) Tj T*
(April to October. The chapters that follow are arranged from north to south, in the) Tj T*
(order a ship entering the bay would pass them.) Tj T*
ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 296 40 Td (Page 1) Tj ET
endstream
